    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"stillness\" you're talking about... it just sounds like more work. another thing to try, another person to talk to. i don't want to find stability. i think part of me just wants to stop fighting the current. everything feels so temporary and meaningless, like i'm just a ghost passing through places. is it really such a bad thing to just let go and let the drift take over?",
